    "employment_weights": "dax/data_built/oews_wages.parquet"
  },
  "note_on_dingel_neiman": "teleworkable is published as a binary at O*NET-SOC detail level; collapsed here to the share of an occupation's detail codes that are teleworkable, which is what the 6-digit SOC merge requires.",
